1
00:00:07,030 --> 00:00:11,134
视频配音，不只是为画面添加声音。
Video dubbing is more than adding sound to a picture.

2
00:00:11,334 --> 00:00:17,046
这也是视频配音与传统文本转语音之间最关键的区别。
This is the key difference between video dubbing and conventional text-to-speech.

3
00:00:17,246 --> 00:00:21,878
它需要理解人物的表情、口型与场景节奏；
It must understand facial expression, lip motion, and scene rhythm.

4
00:00:22,078 --> 00:00:26,038
从文本中把握语义、发音和停顿；
It must also interpret meaning, pronunciation, and pauses from text.

5
00:00:26,238 --> 00:00:31,350
再由参考语音确定目标声音的身份与表达风格。
A reference voice then anchors the target voice's identity and expressive style.

6
00:00:31,550 --> 00:00:37,502
OpenDub 将这些信息组织为一个可交互、可解释的统一任务。
OpenDub organizes these signals into one interactive, intelligible task.

7
00:00:37,702 --> 00:00:46,366
最终，所有信号在同一条时间线上协同，形成与画面同步的目标语音和配音视频。
Finally, they work on one synchronized timeline to form target speech and a dubbed video aligned with the scene.

8
00:00:46,388 --> 00:00:55,340
在统一的视频配音任务之上，OpenDub 汇集了团队面向不同场景持续发展的原创完整方法。
On top of one video-dubbing task, OpenDub brings together original complete methods developed by our team for different scenes.

9
00:00:55,540 --> 00:00:59,932
HPMDubbing 关注视觉节奏与韵律协同。
HPMDubbing focuses on visual rhythm and prosodic coordination.

10
00:01:00,132 --> 00:01:04,308
StyleDubber 面向清晰发音与角色风格。
StyleDubber addresses clear pronunciation and character style.

11
00:01:04,508 --> 00:01:07,940
EmoDubber 提供可控的情感表达。
EmoDubber provides controllable emotional expression.

12
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:14,620
它们各自服务于不同的表达重点，也保留独立而完整的建模路径。
Each serves a different expressive priority while retaining an independent, complete modeling path.

13
00:01:14,820 --> 00:01:21,060
这种完整方法导向，让研究线索和用户选择始终保持清晰。
This complete-method orientation keeps both research traces and user choices clear.

14
00:01:21,260 --> 00:01:36,980
OpenDub 保持每种方法的完整性，并让用户以完整方法为单位理解、浏览和选择。通过 Method Canvas，方法的核心模块、信号路径与设计重点都可以逐层查看。
OpenDub preserves every method as a complete approach, so users can understand, inspect, and select it as a whole. Method Canvas exposes its key modules, signal paths, and design priorities layer by layer.

15
00:01:37,180 --> 00:01:42,316
更多方法也会随着 OpenDub 的持续开发不断加入。
More methods will join as OpenDub continues to grow.

16
00:01:42,338 --> 00:01:45,986
如下是几种方法的基本效果展示。
The following presents representative results from several methods.

17
00:02:03,438 --> 00:02:13,614
OpenDub 的 Compare 工作台将归档媒体、时间波形、Mel 频谱、基频和能量曲线放在同一个可交互界面中。
OpenDub's Compare workbench brings archived media, waveforms, Mel spectrograms, pitch, and energy curves into one interactive view.

18
00:02:13,814 --> 00:02:22,358
用户可以沿着场景索引切换视频，并观察每个文件的视听特征如何随选择同步更新。
Users can move through the scene index and observe each file's audiovisual features update with the selection.

19
00:02:43,235 --> 00:02:51,371
当选定文件切换时，所有特征并非静态装饰，而是与当前媒体记录同步更新。
When the selected file changes, every feature is refreshed with the current media record rather than serving as static decoration.

20
00:02:51,571 --> 00:03:05,443
同一界面中的图像帧和声音轨迹，帮助用户把主观听感与可观察的声学细节联系起来，并为方法比较与研究复用保留同一条可追溯的上下文。
Frames and sound trajectories in one view connect subjective listening with observable acoustic detail, retaining one traceable context for method comparison and research reuse.

21
00:03:05,643 --> 00:03:16,323
这样的可视化，让视频配音不再只是一个最终音频结果，而成为能够被聆听、观察和讨论的多模态创作过程。
This visualization turns video dubbing from a final audio result into a multimodal creative process that can be heard, observed, and discussed.

22
00:03:16,338 --> 00:03:26,970
OpenDub 同时把开源研究转化为可追溯的工作流。Evidence 记录方法的代码、版本、媒体与权利信息。
OpenDub also turns open research into a traceable workflow. Evidence records each method's code, version, media, and rights information.

23
00:03:27,170 --> 00:03:33,098
每一项归档资源，都保留对应的来源、版本和使用边界。
Every archived asset retains its associated source, version, and usage boundary.

24
00:03:33,298 --> 00:03:42,658
Studio 则将视频、文本、参考语音、方法选择与授权状态组织成清晰的项目准备界面。
Studio organizes video, text, reference speech, method selection, and authorization state into a clear project-preparation workspace.

25
00:03:42,858 --> 00:03:49,026
在 Studio 中，输入与方法选择围绕实际项目准备流程呈现。
In Studio, inputs and method selection are presented around a practical project-preparation flow.

26
00:03:49,226 --> 00:03:52,922
这也让团队协作保持透明和连贯。
It also keeps collaboration transparent and continuous.

27
00:03:53,122 --> 00:04:01,690
这种从证据到准备界面的衔接，也为后续的协作、复现和持续维护建立共同基础。
This connection from evidence to preparation also establishes a shared foundation for later collaboration, reproduction, and sustained maintenance.

28
00:04:01,890 --> 00:04:08,538
这样，研究成果既能被展示，也能被理解、复用和持续完善。
In this way, research contributions can be presented, understood, reused, and continuously improved.

29
00:04:08,560 --> 00:04:16,264
OpenDub 汇聚本团队原创的完整视频配音方法，形成开放、可交互的平台。
OpenDub brings together original complete video-dubbing methods developed by our team into an open, interactive platform.

30
00:04:16,464 --> 00:04:29,016
Methods 用于理解与选择，Examples 和 Compare 呈现归档结果与声学证据，Evidence 和 Studio 让资源与项目准备保持可追溯。
Methods supports understanding and selection; Examples and Compare present archived results and acoustic evidence; Evidence and Studio keep resources and project preparation traceable.

31
00:04:29,216 --> 00:04:36,800
OpenDub 将持续扩展方法与工具，让视频配音研究更可理解、更可复用。
OpenDub will continue to expand its methods and tools, making video-dubbing research easier to understand and reuse.
